{"supplier":"hotelbeds","supplierHotelId":"504925","name":"Royal Seginus","description":"This hotel with a very special design is located in a paradisiac place, by the sea. The Antalya Airport can be reached within 20-minute drive. The hotel rooms are very spacious, bright and modern. They have services such as tea and coffee making facilities, private bathroom with amenities and hairdryer, air-conditioning and safe. The hotel offers a fantastic spa where guests can enjoy numerous body treatments to take care of while relaxing including sauna, Turkish baths and hot tub. Guests can also enjoy the Mediterranean breeze at the hotel's garden and terrace. Guests can relax at a seasonal outdoor and indoor pool. The perfect choice for any vacation, the hotel boasts spectacular beaches, outstanding service, and thrilling activities such as sport competitions, evening shows, musicals and kids activities. Sure to please any traveller, the property is proud to offer outstanding service and superior accommodations.","address":"Lara Turizm Merkezi, Kundu, *","city":"ANTALYA","countryCode":"TR","postalCode":"07110","lat":36.8580637,"lng":30.8916175,"stars":5,"chain":"STOGR","giataCode":"537970","phone":"+902423521414","email":"rezervasyon@stonegrouphotels.com","website":"www.stonegroup.com.tr","images":[{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/50/504925/504925a_hb_a_008.jpg","category":"exterior","order":0},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/50/504925/504925a_hb_a_009.jpg","category":"exterior","order":1},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/50/504925/504925a_hb_a_011.jpg","category":"exterior","order":2},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/50/504925/504925a_hb_a_012.jpg","category":"exterior","order":3},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/50/504925/504925a_hb_a_006.jpg","category":"exterior","order":4},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/50/504925/504925a_hb_a_007.jpg","category":"exterior","order":5}